         <description>
            <p>
               SubframeQualityReview 0.78.3 marks lights rejected by the WBPP run log, even when paths differ in capitalization. The review toolbar can reject lower-scoring lights and mask detected trails on copies of retained registered frames. Integrate retained lights using the saved WBPP settings and blink each reviewed master against the original. Disabled inputs stay excluded. Adding registered lights outside the saved integration requires explicit selection.
            </p>
